The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition follows on from the acclaimed "Sexual Healing Guide: For Beginners," only this time the content is Adult Orientated. Mapped out and providing a Step-by-Step Course from the Basics, to the most Advanced in 'Friendship' and 'Relationship' building. Are You: Single and looking to approach that Special Someone, but don't know how to start... Just out of a Relationship and want to further your Prospects... In a Marriage that needs a little more Spice... Divorced and Fallen Off Of The Horse, but don't know how to get back on it... Then you need "The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition" with its 'No-Nonsense' approach to both 'Friendships' and 'Relationships' both. Giving the Reader in-depth Information, Facts, Advice and Secrets that have been long forgotten on 'Sexual Behaviour' and 'Animalistic Behaviour'. Casanova Da Vinci guides you through the initial minefield of 'First Contact', steering you into the 'Ice-Breaker' and by following a systematic short Self Help Course, you will have the Confidence and Flare to nurture a Normal Healthy Relationship. Or learn how to become a 'Triple Shooter'; a rare breed of Lover who can bring excitement and amazement to any intimate moment. For the first time, Casanova Da Vinci shares his experience that span over 4 decades..."­
ªWhen Lord Terrence O'Neill dies unexpectedly, the whole world is sent into a state of chaos, politically, publicly and sociably. His standing within the public, private and secret societies among the wealthy and rich Socialites is crumbling, while the one heir destined to take his place as Lord of the Manor is yet too young to be appointed. Seventeen year old Master Xander O'Neill, son of Lady Maria and Lord Terrence, has but one year to bring Order to Chaos; by reuniting the Twelve Houses (Secret Orders) of the world and stop a global collapse that would send every nation back into the Dark Ages forever. But this quest would not be easy, as waiting in the shadows, splinter Factions and Order's of both Light and Dark, are hell bent on stopping him from succeeding. From Britain to Europe, Master Xander O'Neill must find the trust in alliances, family from friends and discover truths of himself before taking his place upon the seat of Cacciatori Svlegliari Villa - Wolf Wake Manor - one of the twelve houses that rule over the governance of the countries political, authoritive and social infrastructures. Forced on the run, Xander must survive the grueling, fast paced under handed tactics of a corrupt system that will stop at nothing to keep him from acquiring The Harpsen; he who holds The Harpsen holds the power of The Four Corners, as he who rules The Four Corners rules the world.
