¯From 1979 to 1990 the British government had acquired a truce with Russia on the strategic targeting of its I.C.B.M's, this spelling the end of "The Cold War" and so beginning the founding stones of the domino trail that would lead the way to a whole new decade ahead. But deep in the background of all these world events and political concessions there stood a much darker plan manifesting within the ranks of 'The Law Lords', better known between The Secret Societies as the infamous "Baker's Dozen"; 13 men who control the nation's public, while they, the Lords themselves succumb to those 'Four Houses' of great power: The MoD, Police, Civil Services and Justice. As one 'Secret Order' to the next lock horns in the battle for global supremacy, only one with hope of uniting them all and bring balance within The Orders' stands in their way.
When Lord Terrence O'Neill dies through ill health, his son Master Xander O'Neill is put in line to become the next Lord of The House, though this is no normal House. As the young man of seventeen is not seen in the eyes of the Law as old enough to lead his own 'Order', he is challenged for power and title. As the Global Order's start to weaken, crack and fall through catastrophic events they put it upon themselves to protect him as others hunt to kill the Master, his journey is accompanied by friends and enemies alike; those who stay close assist him in many fetes and challenges, as those who are distant lay down their web of deceit, betrayal, loathing and lust for the chance to destroy the young man's soul - by destroying the Family O'Neill name.
From Seacliffe to London, Scotland to Amsterdam, Xander fends for himself while discovering that he is more valuable to "The Orders'" dead than alive. Knowing this his Aunt, Lady Melissa James-Cartwright assigns him the protection of CPS Officers who are previous employees of "The Agency", an intricate asset of The Home Office. And, as they each play their role in the Power Game; each being the descendant of a Noble, while each having their value and position defined by what they are: Ace of Clubs to The King of Diamonds - The House of Cards. Officially known as "The Jack of Diamonds", not only will Xander be taking his place at Cacciatori Svegliarsi Villa - "Hunter's Wake Manor" - but become a Lord, as well as becoming one step closer to the one true power in which to change the whole world "The Harpsen"; he who holds "The Harpsen" control's "The Four Corners"."³
°The Isle of Storm has had many tales to tell over the past ten thousand years; tales of Gods walking its soil, tainting its earth, battling the human mages of old, and watching, guiding, taunting the humans that remain there. From the pilot novel, "The Brotherhood Of The Realms", the history of Storm Island is revealed piece by piece, from present to past, and vice-versa, the route is never the same - though the ending in most cases is of spilt blood and baring the ultimate sacrifice that only a mortal human being can offer. Whether your taste is in the crime or the horror, the outcome will be both the same, as you take to your journey down a road less traveled. Choose from the shorts of The Man In Black, The Haunting Of The Dog, Awakening, or that of The Bluebell Mystery. Each has its very own story to tell, each as individual as the next, but all with one true fact in common - The Isle of Storm. Death is not necessarily the end."¿
¼Formerly known as "The Brotherhood Of Justice". The City of Seacliffe lying in the centre of Storm Island is riddled with crime; the criminals do as they please within the locked confines of "The Maze", a once peaceful housing estate which housed decent people and families. Today, it has nothing to offer except the ghosts of broken homes, broken people and a mad leader that sees over everything from racketeering to drug dealing. When Marcus Chance, a young rebel rouser steps onto the wrong side of the law, he is immediately brought up against one Judge and police officer who give him one of three choices; freedom through service, a long prison sentence or a life of hell that would last a very short time. Only by initiating this young teenager into 'C.I.B', does the Master Mind behind "Project Shadow-Runner" believe peace and civility will once again be restored to the island. For the first time since 1992, "The Brotherhood Of The Realms" will take you on a rollercoaster ride far beyond the realms of reality, and far beyond the safety beacons of your wake. As the storyline unravels in this Pilot Novel that is to bring the Storm Island Saga full circle, there are no hopes of peace from the evil tainted wood that surrounds this god cursed island. Note* "The Brotherhood Of The Realms" is the Pilot novel which first introduces Marcus Chance to the Story-Short compilation's which follow on in "On A Storyteller's Night Book 1: The Beginning", an 11 chapter Story-Short Volume novel that takes the reader deeper into the curse of the tranquil island which is cursed from the gods."Á
¾The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition
With more than 40 years' experience and research, Casanova Da Vinci's most eagerly awaited second novel is now ready to be released. With constructive Advice, Know How, How To..., and a vast quantity of Valued Knowledge, the Guide shows the Reader 'Key Stones', 'Precursors', 'Variables' and 'POV's' that will not be found in any other Reference Book or Novel.
Based on 'One of a Kind' information, Casanova Da Vinci looks into 'Attraction', how to 'Attract' those you wish to see you, and construct a fully workable course of progression into 'First Contact'. From 'Breaking The Ice', to 'Getting your coat and leaving - with the Woman', the course Reconstructs and Presents the Reader with the necessary Steps to fulfil their wishes or goal(s).
From the 'Back at her place' stage, Casanova Da Vinci takes a detailed look into 'Sexual Intercourse', the places in which we carry these physical positions out, and also, what comes from deciding whether or not to Begin a Relationship or choose to have it as a 'One-Off', 'Casual', 'One Night Stand', or be as Confident as you like for it to become a 'Lasting Relationship'.
Taking every caution to put to paper the advantages of 'Attraction', 'Compassion' and 'Trust', it is within the channels of 'Marriage' and 'Divorce', that Casanova Da Vinci brings Secrets and Methods in which to reverse - not all cases - of two people 'Breaking Up', 'Splitting', or ultimately calling it a day and 'Divorcing', while giving them a chance to 'Repair', 'Heal', 'Fix' their 'Marriage'.
Going back to the simple Basics, the Reader will see first-hand a 'Guide' that is essential to anyone who is needing information on how to overcome many of life's obstacles; starting with setting up a new house to become a home, dealing with the surroundings of your new habitat, knowing the rules that apply to everyone, and making the foundations for the arrival of 'Love'...
If you have never had a "Relationship" (physical or otherwise) then you will have the advantage; as all techniques change through each new generation, which is why there are two sections that will accompany those Prefixes. Told from multi-angled view, also giving reference for the Woman, too, it is the Test of the water and following of The Guide that is to bring together two people who would otherwise be complete strangers - and carry on being as such - if it wasn't for "The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition".
As well as 'Relationship Building', Casanova brings to the foreground 'Separation' and 'Divorce', something that many of us hate or loathe hearing about, let alone being in the middle of it. Here the emphasis is on 'Repair', and if you know that it cannot be 'Fixed', then why not read this section?
Using techniques that were lost or forgotten, Casanova Da Vinci looks into 'Re-Lighting the Spark' and 'Rebuilding' the broken Marriage to a whole new height, whether in the 'Marriage' itself, or in the 'Sexual Pleasure' that can be learned and acted out. Even for those who are 'Off the Horse'; an English phrase that means you are down from a 'Relationship', but you're not out of 'The Race'.
You will find useful, valuable and sometimes treasurable information throughout "The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition", as well as visually experience some of the more 'Erotic Examples'. And by opening up to people as a collective audience, maturity and understanding of each others needs, their solutions and executions should be sought and become successful."Ã
ÀFor more than 300 years, the two towns that border Yorkshire's borders of North and East: Evermore and Borello, have been at war; through each generation since the very first in the late 1700's, to present, both families have been taught by their peers to hate their neighbors, while all the while during countless battles, something has caused a great change in each their retaliations.
For the Duchess of Evermore, Lady Melissa Ellington-Evermore, the present day changes in her family have led to the death of her youngest daughter, Carrie Brindley-White.
Lady Evermore's husband, Lord David Evermore, the last remaining Evermore, is too saddened to bury his daughter, because he is inconsolably troubled to find that her death was through no accident, but murder.
In Borello, Lady Alice Gruber, the land owner of Borello and all of its houses and businesses, comes head to head with the hands that deal fate. And from "Evermore" to the dark, seedy confines of "The Quarter", love, passion, lust and depravity may well conquer all within the adult erotic stories of The Bordello Tales."Ò
ÏBorello is falling. Unknown influences have initiated what the Local Overseers call "Protocol 15"; the introduction of Regal Command and Deployment, including Enforcer's and The King's Elite Guard. It was the one Protocol that nobody, not even Evermore's High Guard thought would ever happen.
Between the Sanctions and influx of Enforcer's, one man in particular becomes hell bent on ridding Borello of its high intake of Vigilante's, especially one: The Borello Hood - Lord Lucas Aidan Cavendish; Lord and favored future Overseer of Evermore Town by day, deadly trained Assassin who fights for the people of Borello by night.
Running with Lucas - The Borello Hood - are Lady Elizabeth Spinks -aka Deadly Night Shade, Danielle La Grande -aka Midnight Blaze, and Lord Michael Slattery-Gruber -aka The Grey Shadow, the group of Vigilante's tagged by the people as being "The Bordello 3". Their only cause in an embittered war between Evermore Town, to bring peace and prosperity to a town long left in the wake of Draconian rule and persecution.
The 12 Houses of the world are spiraling into chaos; London's hold of politicians have split "The House Of Cards", while in other, more sanctified placements "The Knight's Castle" is at war with its global Order's. This for Lucas and Michael is what the Nobles believe to be called "The Calling"; a method that was used to bring the Houses and Royals of the world together during the 1165 B.C defeat of Vorelee - one of the very first Gods to walk the Earth.
The only hope for the two towns to reach peace comes in the shape of "The Harpsen": He who holds The Harpsen, controls The Four Corners - He who controls The Four Corners, then controls the World. For Lord Lucas, his fate has already been predicted and told. But for his friends, only a true miracle will bring them ever closer to peace...
Written By Casanova Da Vinci"Ú
×Once considered a "Very Private" collection of Poetry that has been written by Marcus De Storm, The Private Poet shares many pieces that were resulted from personal friendships, relationships, inner-deep thoughts and the conduit source in which to release anger, lustre and heartache. In this new edition of carefully selected poems, the author has included those singular pieces which were at one time sworn from being released into the public's view. Here you will read the poems of love as well as the results of love, and discover from one Poet's point of view exactly how destructive it can be."Ý
